From 5b79ef8d12b0e3d5de42c3299b9468466e247113 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 10:56:32 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] fix(ci): repair corrupted workflows and misplaced files

- Remove "[cite: N]" artifacts and duplicate uses:/run: keys that made
  build, ci, codeql, config and main workflows invalid YAML
- Rebuild main.yml (escaped \${{ }}, missing vercel-project-id)
- Build the existing multi-target Dockerfile with `target:` instead of the
  nonexistent Dockerfile.api / Dockerfile.web (ci-cd, docker-build,
  docker-publish, container-security, preview, frontend maintainer paths)
- Restore the DB password placeholder in frontend-platform-maintainer
- Declare optional Vercel secrets on vercel-deploy workflow_call
- Remove non-workflow YAML (k8s manifests, render, kustomization, datadog,
  coderabbit, dependabot) that GitHub parsed as invalid workflows; identical
  copies already exist at the repo root / .github

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01MKxW7uieSpsnf9U1ngrtGU
